{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"cxrr@112","phase":"action","pageId":"page@6b60c32c6e4e0296821ed44a7305945e","frameId":"frame@ab9640857fee1aee0c0e4182b3e4828c","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:5173/play","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"__playwright_scroll_top_":"1130","lang":"en"},[[15,2]],[[17,32]],["BODY",{},[[17,33]],["DIV",{"id":"root"},["DIV",{"class":"min-h-screen bg-background px-4 pb-16 pt-10 text-foreground sm:px-6"},["MAIN",{"class":"mx-auto max-w-3xl"},[[1,4]],["DIV",{"class":"grid gap-8"},["DIV",{"class":"rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 text-center"},["P",{"class":"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-foreground"},"Room code"],["P",{"class":"mt-2 font-display text-5xl tracking-[0.16em]"},"BEYG3"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-5 flex justify-center"},["BUTTON",{"data-slot":"button","data-variant":"outline","data-size":"default","class":"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:pointer-events-none [&_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 px-4 py-2 has-[>svg]:px-3 h-10 uppercase tracking-[0.18em]","type":"button"},"Copy code"]],["P",{"class":"mt-5 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground"},"Lobby open — players can still join"]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-xl border-2 border-foreground/70 bg-card p-5"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"},["DIV",{},["P",{"class":"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-foreground"},"Rules briefing"],["H2",{"class":"mt-1 font-display text-2xl tracking-tight"},"How Shadow Hunt is played"]]],["P",{"class":"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/90"},"Read this before the head start. You will be asked to confirm that you understand it — the organiser cannot start the match until everyone has."],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 grid gap-4"},["DIV",{},["H3",{"class":"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]"},"Two teams"],["UL",{"class":"mt-1 grid gap-1"},["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Teams are drawn at random when the match starts and never change after that."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Hunters tag Shadows by scanning their QR code. Shadows survive by staying out of reach until the timer runs out."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","If every Shadow is caught, the Hunters win. If the timer runs out with a Shadow still free, the Shadows win."]]],["DIV",{},["H3",{"class":"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]"},"The head start"],["UL",{"class":"mt-1 grid gap-1"},["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Shadows get a head start before Hunters can see anything. Nobody's location is uploaded or revealed during it."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","The match goes live the moment the head start ends, and points start counting from then."]]],["DIV",{},["H3",{"class":"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]"},"The play area"],["UL",{"class":"mt-1 grid gap-1"},["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Everyone plays inside one zone. It shrinks on a fixed schedule, and the radius is shown on your screen."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Stay inside: past a short grace period your points drain, and after about three minutes outside you are out of the match."]]],["DIV",{},["H3",{"class":"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]"},"Tagging"],["UL",{"class":"mt-1 grid gap-1"},["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","A tag only counts when both phones are roughly 40 m apart and both positions are current — within the last 30 seconds."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Open your code only when you are really caught. A refused scan costs the Hunter nothing and can be reported."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Once you are caught you choose what happens next: Spectator, join the Hunters, or Helper."]]],["DIV",{},["H3",{"class":"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]"},"Complaints"],["UL",{"class":"mt-1 grid gap-1"},["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","If a Shadow will not show their code, report it from the match screen and name who it was."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","An invigilator has a short, fixed window to answer, and every decision they make is logged."]]],["DIV",{},["H3",{"class":"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]"},"What the pings show"],["UL",{"class":"mt-1 grid gap-1"},["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Hunters do not see Shadows live. Every few minutes a ping reveals where each free Shadow last was — a ghost that fades."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Spectators and Helpers see exactly the same thing a Hunter sees."],["LI",{"class":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"},"· ","Invigilators see everything live so they can settle disputes."]]]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 rounded-lg border-2 border-foreground/60 p-3 text-[14px] font-semibold leading-relaxed"},"Stay off roads and private property. Play in daylight, keep aware of your surroundings, and look after the people around you — a game is never worth an injury. If something goes wrong, use the “I need help” button."],["DIV",{"class":"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3"},["BUTTON",{"__playwright_target__":"","data-slot":"button","data-varian